   "text": "Phase 2: hardware validation\n- done: lab discover and live capture (D435)\n- record/replay with pyrealsense2 2.55 (pinned)\n- connect on USB 3, run lab discover again\n- check the VLM licence on the model card\n- live run with light: pet names + summary\n- lab calibrate: floor plane + zones",
   "originalText": "Phase 2: hardware validation\n- done: lab discover and live capture (D435)\n- record/replay with pyrealsense2 2.55 (pinned)\n- connect on USB 3, run lab discover again\n- check the VLM licence on the model card\n- live run with light: pet names + summary\n- lab calibrate: floor plane + zones",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "td2",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
